{"id":72161,"date":"2026-11-01T07:31:39","date_gmt":"2026-11-01T07:31:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72161"},"modified":"2026-11-01T08:35:09","modified_gmt":"2026-11-01T07:35:09","slug":"sao-silvestre-chaves","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-chaves\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Chaves 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Chaves 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Chaves 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>26 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong>, com partida e chegada na <strong>Pra\u00e7a General Silveira<\/strong>, no centro hist\u00f3rico da cidade de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-vila-real\/\">Chaves (distrito de Vila Real)<\/a>. Esta cl\u00e1ssica noturna transmontana re\u00fane atletas federados e populares num ambiente festivo de fim de ano pelas principais art\u00e9rias flavienses, com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es 100% gratuitas at\u00e9 20 de dezembro de 2026.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\">Corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre de 10 km<\/a> (destinada a participantes nascidos em 2008 e anteriores, com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, tempo limite de 90 minutos e abastecimentos de \u00e1gua aos 4 km e 7 km) e uma <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/caminhadas\/\">Caminhada de 7 km<\/a> aberta a toda a popula\u00e7\u00e3o, com direito a medalha de finalista e refei\u00e7\u00e3o conv\u00edvio no final. A prova \u00e9 limitada a 500 vagas na corrida e 500 vagas na caminhada (com oferta de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica para as 1.000 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es) e distribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios na geral e nos escal\u00f5es Sub-23, Seniores, V40, V+40 e V+50. Podes planear o teu ritmo de prova na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Chaves<\/strong> com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e arbitragem da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Vila Real<\/strong>. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 18:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pra\u00e7a General Silveira, Chaves, Vila Real<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: